; Coverage test for draft.cc xact_command with complex transactions
; Exercises draft.cc: 'at' keyword, matching multi-post xacts
; and account mask lookup in matching transaction posts.
; A draft that keeps a copied posting's amount keeps its written @ cost
; too, so the printed draft parses back to the same transaction.

2024/01/15 * Stock Purchase
    Assets:Brokerage         10 AAPL @ $150.00
    Assets:Checking       $-1500.00

test xact 2024/03/01 at 'Stock Purchase' Brokerage 5 from Checking
2024/03/01 Stock Purchase
    Assets:Brokerage                          5 AAPL
    Assets:Checking
end test

test xact 2024/03/01 'Stock Purchase'
2024/03/01 Stock Purchase
    Assets:Brokerage                         10 AAPL @ $150.00
    Assets:Checking                        $-1500.00
end test

test xact 2024/03/01 'Stock Purchase' Brokerage
2024/03/01 Stock Purchase
    Assets:Brokerage                         10 AAPL @ $150.00
    Assets:Checking
end test
